                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E=Sh_{(2,1)}(X)
            of (2,1)-sheaves on a topological space, then we conclude that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mover
